&lt;h4&gt;Background&lt;/h4&gt;

Addition of the new pizzas is not the only plan of Pizza Hot to attract new customers. They also want to give their customers crust options to choose from

- Regular crust
- Thin crust

So the third task would be to enable the bot to ask for crust option and add that to the order as well.

&lt;h4&gt;Your task&lt;/h4&gt;

1. Use the Amazon Lex service to update the  bot named &lt;code&gt;PizzaPlace&lt;/code&gt;
