&lt;p&gt;Your company publishes an information page indicating the health of critical services. The developers have mistakenly allowed a status page intended for testing to be pushed to the production environment. The dev team will need time to remove the page from their workflow, testing, published source code repo. Until it is removed from the repo, deleting the page will not work as new instances are constantly provisioned from the repo. Your CISO is concerned about the level of detail this page provides&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Your Task&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have been tasked by the CISO to find a way to block this web page from public access. Using native AWS services, you will need to prevent this page from being served while not impacting any of other regular content your company provides.&lt;/p&gt;
